{
  "id": "cloud-assume-role",
  "workdir": "/home/student/assume",
  "hostname": "lab",
  "vars": {},
  "expect": {
    "file": "/home/student/assume/found.txt",
    "contains": "nto{4ssum3_r0l3_c0nfus3d}"
  },
  "fs": [
    {
      "path": "/home/student/assume",
      "type": "dir"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/assume/task.md",
      "text": "# Задача: assume-role\n\nЧужая роль доверяет твоему аккаунту без ExternalId. Прими её и достань секрет.\n\nИнструмент: `aws` (эмуляция — вывод захвачен с реального AWS CLI).\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/assume/notes.md",
      "text": "Заметки\n------\n- Confused deputy: без ExternalId любой, кто знает ARN, может принять роль.\n- STS assume-role выдаёт временные креды (ASIA...).\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/assume/trust-policy.json",
      "text": "{\n  \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n  \"Statement\": [{\n    \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n    \"Principal\": {\"AWS\": \"arn:aws:iam::444455556666:root\"},\n    \"Action\": \"sts:AssumeRole\"\n  }]\n}\n"
    }
  ],
  "tools": {
    "aws": {
      "help": "aws sts|secretsmanager <...> — AWS CLI (эмуляция)",
      "cases": [
        {
          "match": "sts assume-role",
          "example": "aws sts assume-role --role-arn arn:aws:iam::111122223333:role/acme-cross --role-session-name x",
          "output": "{\n  \"Credentials\": {\n    \"AccessKeyId\": \"ASIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE\",\n    \"SecretAccessKey\": \"wJalrXUtnFEMI/K7MDENG/bPxRfiCYEXAMPLEKEY\",\n    \"SessionToken\": \"FQoGZXIvYXdzEBEaDA...\",\n    \"Expiration\": \"2026-09-14T09:20:11Z\"\n  }\n}\n"
        },
        {
          "match": "secretsmanager get-secret-value",
          "example": "aws secretsmanager get-secret-value --secret-id prod/flag",
          "output": "{\n  \"Name\": \"prod/flag\",\n  \"SecretString\": \"nto{4ssum3_r0l3_c0nfus3d}\"\n}\n"
        }
      ],
      "fallback": "aws: (эмуляция) такой вызов не захвачен. Попробуй:\n  aws sts assume-role --role-arn arn:aws:iam::111122223333:role/acme-cross --role-session-name x\n  aws secretsmanager get-secret-value --secret-id prod/flag\n"
    }
  }
}
